?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hPg2g03VMLYQ7kNvwHTZa6A&_nc_oc=AdrvIhSAZtFsaatNrV7onEHhMdG2jJRRhufbPcp8RTbwV8CUxMIz96i205ySMl8dP5w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLuaFyJFazb_MP1hm7agP-u4gU0ZHRtLlYmmrmDAae27g&oe=6A9D60F2"}, "display_name": "Shopenkraft\u2019s Quantum Curiosities", "keywords": ["Crafting", "Cozy", "Shopkeeper", "Simulator", "Sandbox"], "long_description": "Shopenkraft reaches for the stars! Run a traveling tech shop from the back of your ~~van~~ spaceship!\n\nThe game features **over 50 different modules** that you can freely mix and match to create all sorts of useful (or dysfunctional) products.\nSome modules cancel each other out, but others create unique effects and functionalities. **Experiment with different configurations** to discover everything!\n\nAnd if you feel like some of your creations are useless... Remember that the customer is always right!\n\n\n**KEY FEATURES**\n- **Unleash Your Creativity:** Freely combine over 50 different modules into weird and awesome products. Endgame variations are effectively endless!\n- **Master Your Space:** Tinker with levers, switches and buttons to produce the various modules. Experience the satisfying zen feeling as you flow effortlessly through your workshop.\n- **No Work, All Play:** Take a break from your inventive genius. Test your creations on innocent glassware, play a tune on your authentic xylophone, or give your pet slime a good, loving squish!\n- **Nurture Your Business:** Start with a humble shop and build it into a thriving emporium, one upgrade at a time. Optimize the workshop to rake in those sweet credits!\n- **Enchant Your Customers:** Adapt to the quirks of your interstellar clientele and use your adorable robotic assistants to keep the customers happy.\n- **Enjoy The Ride:** Take your time. Adventure across the galaxy and bask in alien vistas. Customize your cozy ship and make it your own.\n{866214486033696}\n{3997557257215238}\n{101953304